(DATHEON TECH SOLUTIONS - EMPLOYEE HANDBOOK & COMPANY POLICIES) Tj
T*
(Document Ref: POL-2025-V2.1 | Effective Date: January 1, 2025) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 1: ORGANIZATIONAL MISSION & WORKING HOURS) Tj
T*
(Datheon Tech Solutions is a premier artificial intelligence research and consulting firm) Tj
T*
(specializing in enterprise LangChain agents, high-throughput RAG systems, and structured LLM extraction.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1.1 Standard Working Hours:) Tj
T*
(- Official office hours are 9:30 AM to 6:30 PM Indian Standard Time \(IST\), Monday through Friday.) Tj
T*
(- Core synchronous team collaboration hours are 11:00 AM to 4:00 PM IST.) Tj
T*
(- All team members are expected to be reachable via Slack during core collaboration hours.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1.2 Annual Paid Time Off \(PTO\):) Tj
T*
(- Full-time engineers receive 24 paid vacation days annually, accrued monthly at 2 days per month.) Tj
T*
(- Employees receive 10 paid casual/medical sick leaves per calendar year.) Tj
T*
(- National and regional holidays are published in December for the subsequent calendar year.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
