(SECTION 2: HYBRID WORK & EXPENSE REIMBURSEMENT POLICY) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.1 Hybrid Remote Work Model:) Tj
T*
(- Datheon operates on a flexible hybrid model allowing engineers to work remotely up to 3 days per week.) Tj
T*
(- Mandatory in-office collaboration days are Tuesday and Thursday for sprint planning and demos.) Tj
T*
(- Fully remote work arrangements require written approval from the Engineering Director.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.2 Ergonomic Home Office Equipment Stipend:) Tj
T*
(- New full-time hires are eligible for a one-time home office tech stipend of $800 \(or INR 65,000\).) Tj
T*
(- Eligible expenses include ergonomic monitors, standing desk converters, noise-canceling headsets, and chairs.) Tj
T*
(- Receipts must be submitted through the Datheon HR Portal within 60 days of employment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.3 Business Travel & Meal Per Diem:) Tj
T*
(- Approved domestic travel flights must be booked in economy class.) Tj
T*
(- The maximum allowable daily meal per diem is $75 \(or INR 4,500\) per day.) Tj
T*
(- Itemized tax invoices must be submitted with expense claims for audit compliance.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
